{"id":"n62696-2-9","stage":1,"title":"바닥 · 底","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62696-2-9-1","ko":"왜 신발 바닥에 구멍이 났어요?","zh":"为什么鞋底会破洞啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신발","meaning":"鞋","explanation":"신발：鞋","readings":[{"term":"신발","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30213","senseId":"1","lemma":"신발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바닥에","meaning":"底","explanation":"바닥：底；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닥","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62696","senseId":"2","lemma":"바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구멍이","meaning":"窟窿，洞，孔","explanation":"구멍：窟窿，洞，孔；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"구멍","audio":"/audio/bdf45aec9d9cea46cc2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34923","senseId":"1","lemma":"구멍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났어요?","meaning":"钻，打，划","explanation":"나다：钻，打，划；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"3","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"514d3c6f08937125","term":"신발","zh":"鞋","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3","entryId":"30213","definition":"站立或走路时为了保护脚而穿的东西。","pronunciation":["신발"]},{"id":"18c3f3f4b810aab6","term":"바닥","zh":"底","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3","entryId":"62696","definition":"物体的下面部分。","pronunciation":["바닥"]},{"id":"bdf45aec9d9cea46","term":"구멍","zh":"窟窿，洞，孔","audio":"/audio/bdf45aec9d9cea46cc2f.mp3","entryId":"34923","definition":"穿破或挖出的位置。","pronunciation":["구멍"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"钻，打，划","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现洞或伤口等。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/160940ff87a0bf738908.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62696-2-9-2","ko":"뭔가 뾰족한 것을 밟았었나 봐요.","zh":"应该是踩到什么尖锐的东西了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭔가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뾰족한","meaning":"尖，尖锐","explanation":"뾰족하다：尖，尖锐；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"뾰족하다","audio":"/audio/b0228a9b28763d73d9d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62006","senseId":"1","lemma":"뾰족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것을","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밟았었나","meaning":"踩","explanation":"밟다：踩；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"밟다","audio":"/audio/cc2cc4cec780cfa623c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64728","senseId":"1","lemma":"밟다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"b0228a9b28763d73","term":"뾰족하다","zh":"尖，尖锐","audio":"/audio/b0228a9b28763d73d9d6.mp3","entryId":"62006","definition":"物体的边缘部位细而锋利。","pronunciation":["뾰조카다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"cc2cc4cec780cfa6","term":"밟다","zh":"踩","audio":"/audio/cc2cc4cec780cfa623c7.mp3","entryId":"64728","definition":"把脚放在某个对象上面压。","pronunciation":["밥ː따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/37a10616604f2a455624.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62696","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceScore":2.2802,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["为什么鞋底会破洞啊？","应该是踩到什么尖锐的东西了吧。","这个假期你都做了些什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["为什么鞋底会破洞啊？","应该是踩到什么尖锐的东西了吧。","这个假期你都做了些什么？"],"answer":1}]}
